ess.</li><li><strong>Alpha Lipoic Acid:</strong> Slim Metrix features Alpha Lipoic Acid, a powerful antioxidant that supports cellular energy and glucose metabolism. It helps the body convert nutrients into usable energy while supporting insulin sensitivity and protecting cells from oxidative stress, enhancing overall metabolic efficiency and mitochondrial health.</li><li><strong>
